- LEARN: REJECTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: /health?full=true returns identical {"health":"OK"} — no verbose disclosure
- LEARN: ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: preflight-only x-powered-by: Express fingerprint (OPTIONS 204, GET/POST 401 absent) confirmed across /v2/transcription + /v2/pre-recorded
- LEARN: ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: /openapi.json (200, 125131B, CORS `*`, 14 paths, 7 webhooks) publicly exposes full v2 surface including audio_url/video_url with no scheme allowlist
- LEARN: ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: /v1/models (200, 530B, security: null) public endpoint leaks FR+US datacenter regions
- LEARN: ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ app.gladia.io: /dashboard returns 200 SPA shell without auth — client-side enforcement only
- LEARN: ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ app.gladia.io: oauth2 state cookie missing Secure flag — HSTS preload mitigates to informational only

