[RISK] api.gladia.io: 90 | Surface frozen 90+ cycles: OpenAPI 125131B/14 paths/7 webhooks exposed (CORS `*` + ACAH x-gladia-key on preflight), /health 15B undocumented, /v1/models 530B (FR+US egress public), SSRF-by-design (audio_url/video_url/callback_config.url no scheme allowlist + 7 webhook delivery paths), WebSocket token-in-URL per spec, preflight-only x-powered-by: Express fingerprint, POST/GET 401 NestJS key-gated. High business-critical surface; requires valid API key for SSRF POC.

